efaults)", "Tip": "Reverts major optimizations back to standard Windows defaults."}}, "uk": {"1": {"Title": "CPU Core Unpark & Power Plan Lock", "Tip": "Prevents CPU cores from sleeping during games, locking full sustained clock speeds."}, "2": {"Title": "Game Booster Turbo Mode", "Tip": "Closes heavy background browsers, Discord, Spotify and releases RAM before gaming."}, "3": {"Title": "RAM & Standby Cache Purge", "Tip": "Triggers the Windows Garbage Collector to flush idle memory and working sets."}, "4": {"Title": "Universal GPU Shader Cache Purge", "Tip": "Cleans bloated DirectX, NVIDIA DXCache, AMD DxCache and Intel shader caches."}, "5": {"Title": "Enable HAGS (Hardware GPU Scheduling)", "Tip": "Hands GPU scheduling directly to graphics hardware processor, boosting FPS."}, "6": {"Title": "Lock DirectX MaxFrameLatency=1", "Tip": "Caps pre-rendered frame queue to 1 to eliminate rendering input lag."}, "7": {"Title": "Force Fullscreen Optimizations (FSE)", "Tip": "Eliminates DWM borderless composition lag, unlocking true exclusive fullscreen speeds."}, "8": {"Title": "Disable Game DVR Background Recording", "Tip": "Stops Windows from recording video clips in the background to prevent frame drops."}, "9": {"Title": "Lighten DWM Transparency & Blur", "Tip": "Reduces Desktop Window Manager GPU compositor load during gaming."}, "10": {"Title": "Set GDI Process Handle Quota to 65536", "Tip": "Expands UI object limits to prevent crashes in heavily modded games."}, "11": {"Title": "Disable Power Throttling", "Tip": "Stops Windows from artificially throttling CPU wattage during background tasks."}, "12": {"Title": "Disable Fast Startup Memory Leak", "Tip": "Prevents Windows kernel session leaks and stale memory locking across reboots."}, "13": {"Title": "Set Win32PrioritySeparation to 38", "Tip": "Grants foreground games 3x prioritized CPU time slices compared to background apps."}, "14": {"Title": "Set MMCSS Games GPU Priority to 8", "Tip": "Locks Multimedia Class Sche